{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "生态_码头_船工",
  "entry": "root",
  "meta": {
    "title": "守跳板的船工（位面/风评/时辰 五选一；零阻塞、零信号）"
  },
  "nodes": {
    "root": {
      "type": "switch",
      "cases": [
        {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "plane": "背尸"
            }
          ],
          "next": "bs1"
        },
        {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "narrative": "eco_风评",
              "state": "沾晦气",
              "reached": true
            }
          ],
          "next": "hui1"
        },
        {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "timePhase": "夜"
            }
          ],
          "next": "ye1"
        },
        {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "timePhase": "午"
            }
          ],
          "next": "wu1"
        }
      ],
      "defaultNext": "ri1"
    },
    "ri1": {
      "type": "line",
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "literal",
        "name": "船工"
      },
      "text": "跳板上莫站人。货没卸完，你杵到那儿算啥子名堂？",
      "next": "ri2"
    },
    "ri2": {
      "type": "line",
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "literal",
        "name": "船工"
      },
      "text": "要搭手就去脚帮那头挂号，莫来问我。",
      "next": "end"
    },
    "wu1": {
      "type": "line",
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "literal",
        "name": "船工"
      },
      "text": "那几只扁毛畜生天天上岸偷谷子，撵都撵不走。你逮得到，肉归你。",
      "next": "end"
    },
    "ye1": {
      "type": "line",
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "literal",
        "name": "船工"
      },
      "text": "夜里头守船的是我，不是你。走远点。",
      "next": "ye2"
    },
    "ye2": {
      "type": "line",
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "literal",
        "name": "旁白"
      },
      "text": "他说完又把眼睛转回江面上去咯，像是在等啥子东西浮起来。",
      "next": "end"
    },
    "bs1": {
      "type": "line",
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "literal",
        "name": "旁白"
      },
      "text": "他看到你背上那个东西，一句话都没得，把跳板往船上拖咯半尺。",
      "next": "end"
    },
    "end": {
      "type": "end"
    },
    "hui1": {
      "type": "line",
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "literal",
        "name": "船工"
      },
      "text": "晓得你前阵子去咯啥子地方。莫挨拢，我这船明天还要下水。",
      "next": "end"
    }
  }
}
